# Layer 8 MayPlay$ with ReplaceGraveyard$ Exile: during human's turn Kess,
# Dissident Mage lets them cast Divination from the graveyard, and the spell is
# exiled instead of returning to the graveyard when it resolves (it still
# draws two cards).
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 3 U
tapformana human 4 U
tapformana human 5 U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
castspell human 1
resolvestack
